; Quiet-on-green for the whole corpus: the fixture libraries' generated
; inline-test runners would otherwise pay three lines of windtrap chrome
; per partition for one or two trivial tests. WINDTRAP_QUIET only trims
; the green transcript to the summary line — failure blocks, corrections,
; and exit codes are untouched (levels change what prints, never
; outcomes), so the .corrected/runner-exit goldens are unaffected.

(env
 (_
  (env-vars
   (WINDTRAP_QUIET 1))))
